From: Bjarne <87858321+bjakra@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 01:12:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Play keybox: attestation status screen

Adds a read-only "Attestation status" screen under the Play Integrity keybox
settings. KeyboxDiagnostics generates a throwaway attested key to show what this
device's KeyMint really reports (security level, bootloader locked state,
verified boot, certificate root), the keybox's state, and -- when the keybox is
on -- what Play sees instead (locked bootloader, keybox root). The probe key is
deleted after reading and nothing is stored. KeyboxStatusActivity renders it;
KeyboxActivity gains the entry point.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>

